==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**17,300 grants +5 [[Catamin]] [B].
**17,400 grants +5 Catamin [C].
**17,500 grants +5 Legend [[Catseye]]s.
*Added 1 new item used in the [[June Bride of the Devil (Event Gacha)|June Bride of the Devil]] Gacha: Holy Water.
*Increased [[Undead Cat (Special Cat)|Undead Cat]]'s + level cap to 10.
*[[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] and Breakerblast [[Cat Cannon]]s can now target [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] corpses.
*Increased the number of equipment slots to 17.
**Slot 16 requires 90 [[Meow Medals]].
**Slot 17 requires 100 Meow Medals.
*Added a feature where you can use the previous victory line-up by holding the "Equip" button without going into equip menu.
*Viewing the enemies in a stage's map now also shows if there are any one-time rewards left to obtain.

